    {
      "flavor_text": "It takes pride in its strength.\nEven though it can tear foes apart,\nit finishes them off with powerful poison.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "じまんの　パワーで　あいてを\nばらばらに　できるのに　さらに\nもうどくで　とどめを　さすのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "자랑거리인 파워로 상대를\n조각조각 낼 수 있으며 게다가\n맹독으로 마무리한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il met ses adversaires en pièces grâce à sa\nprodigieuse force, puis donne le coup de grâce avec\nson violent poison.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es bringt seine Gegner mit starkem Gift zur Strecke,\nobwohl es weiß, dass es stark genug ist, um sie\nzu zerfetzen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aunque sabe que puede aplastar al rival con su gran\nfuerza, le gusta dar el golpe de gracia con su virulento\nveneno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Va fiero della sua forza con cui può fare a pezzi il\nnemico, ma in genere preferisce finirlo usando le\nsue tossine.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It takes pride in its strength. Even though it can\ntear foes apart, it finishes them off with\npowerful poison.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "自慢の　パワーで　相手を\nばらばらに　できるのに　さらに\n猛毒で　とどめを　刺すのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aunque sabe que puede aplastar al rival con su gran\nfuerza, le gusta dar el golpe de gracia con su virulento\nveneno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "りょううでの　ツメは　じどうしゃを\nスクラップにする　はかいりょく。\nツメの　さきから　どくを　だす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "양팔의 발톱은 자동차를\n동강 내는 파괴력이 있다.\n발톱의 끝에서 독을 뿌린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut réduire une voiture en pièces avec ses pinces.\nLe bout de ses pinces contient du poison.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In seinen Armen steckt so viel Kraft, dass es mit\nseinen giftigen Krallen Autos zerquetschen kann.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus brazos tienen fuerza para destrozar un coche.\nLa punta de sus zarpas segrega veneno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Con le zampe può accartocciare una macchina.\nLe punte degli artigli sono velenose.",
